@page
@{ ViewData["Title"]="Platform"; ViewData["Description"]="Explore the six connected Bridge Dynamics enterprise platform suites."; }
<partial name="_PageHero" model='new PageHero("The Bridge Dynamics platform","A connected operating environment for your entire organisation","Bring people, customers, projects, finance, procurement, operations and governance into one coherent enterprise platform.")' />
<section class="section"><div class="container-xl"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Connected by design</p><h2>Six suites. One operational foundation.</h2><p>Each suite serves a distinct business discipline while sharing organisation structures, permissions, workflows and information.</p></div><div class="card-grid">@foreach(var item in new[]{("Core Platform","The shared foundation for organisation structures, identities, roles, permissions, workflow, notifications and master data."),("People Suite","Coordinate workforce records, leave, performance, time, development and employee operations."),("Customer Suite","Build a connected view of prospects, customers, opportunities, engagements and relationship activity."),("Operations Suite","Manage projects, procurement, assets, requests and the work required to deliver consistently."),("Governance Suite","Structure policies, risk, compliance, approvals, controls and accountable decision-making."),("Insights Suite","Transform connected operational data into dashboards, reports and decision-ready intelligence.")}){<article class="info-card"><div class="icon-box" aria-hidden="true">◆</div><h3>@item.Item1</h3><p>@item.Item2</p></article>}</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-muted"><div class="container-xl"><div class="row g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><p class="eyebrow">Platform architecture</p><h2>Shared controls reduce fragmentation</h2><p>Rather than treating each department as a separate technology estate, Bridge Dynamics provides a common framework for identity, access, information and workflow.</p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><ul class="check-list"><li>Consistent organisational structure</li><li>Role-based access across suites</li><li>Connected records and reporting</li><li>Standard workflow and approval patterns</li><li>Configuration that can evolve with the business</li><li>Customer-specific extensions where justified</li></ul></div></div></div></section><partial name="_FinalCta" />
